# 默认拒绝，仅将应用构建所需源码与配置发送给 Docker。
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!requirements-lock.txt
!ctf_ext/
!ctf_ext/**
!config/
!config/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!cairn/
!cairn/cairn/
!cairn/cairn/**
!cairn/dispatch.local.example.yaml
!cairn/VENDORED.md
!cairn/LICENSE
!docker/
!docker/**
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv*
**/venv
**/*.egg-info
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
